  "name": "catnap",
  "note": "The whole patch, rebuilt from its saved settings: part B is the untriggered Plaits chord drone (C minor steps from a looping Marbles sequence, a slow Tides swell opening and snapping shut the Ripples low-pass) and plays only into part A, where your notes strike the Rings bell and both go into the octave-up Clouds grains, which freeze and thaw at random. Rings is played from the keys here, not by Marbles; Plateau is left out (its saved Wet is 0) and Warps too (its mixer channel is at 0). Like the patch, it drones as soon as it is loaded.",
  "credit": "~zero-g:catnap by plantay (patchstorage.com/zero-gcatnap-vcv-rack-jam)",
  "licence": "CC BY 4.0",
  "order": 1,
  "master": {"Mode": "Single"},
